en:
It is recommended to upload single-person images for better recognition results;
It is recommended to use images where the character's clothing color clearly contrasts with the background;
When generating emotes, it is recommended to use images where the face is fully within the frame, facing the camera, with clear facial features;
When generating actions, it is recommended to use images where the character's full body is visible;
It is recommended to shoot in a bright and open environment; dim or shadowy areas may yield poor results;
A resolution greater than 720P is recommended, with the face occupying more than 10% of the frame;
Currently supports images in .png/.jpg/.jpeg/.bmp/.heic formats.

If on-screen players exceed the display limit, players will show as the mode you choose: 
*Friends Mode: shows teammates and friendly players first; 
*Enemies Mode: shows hostile players first; 
*Distance Mode: shows the closest players first.

Yuan Zhen (Tang Dynasty)
Having sailed the vast seas, no other waters can compare;
Having seen Mount Wu's clouds, none else are mist in the air.
Passing through lush flowerbeds, I care not to glance;
Half for my quiet devotion, half for our bygone romance.

zh:
空间发生颤动，沙尘散去，出现玉门关初见远景鸟瞰;
树船剧烈颤动，复活的船长出树枝将玩家摔下;
玩家从沙地里站起，树船呼啸着向前方行进;
牡丹鱼从沙中跃出吞下玩家，向前方快速游动

en:
Space trembles; dust clears—the first aerial view of Jade Gate Pass appears; 
The treeboat trembles violently. The resurrected captain flings the player off the tree branches; 
The player rises from sand; the treeboat speeds forward; 
The peacock fish leaps from sand, swallows the player, and swims swiftly ahead

New set is available for a limited time.
Softly flowing streams cleanse my robes;
A quiet mind leaves the heart untroubled and free.

#YBeyond Mundane#E is a new Homestead scene featuring the new industry #Y[Cloudrest Passage]#E, which automatically inherits the Homestead level.
Within the Cloudrest Passage industry area, you can freely conduct Homestead and personal construction;
#YBuildings#E already unlocked in the Homestead can be #Yduplicated#E in the Cloudrest Passage. For example, when Porcelain Kiln reaches Lv. 6, you can build up to 4 Porcelain Kiln Tile Sheds in Qinghe. After the update, without affecting existing Porcelain Kiln Tile Sheds in Qinghe, you can additionally place 4 Porcelain Kiln Tile Sheds in Cloudrest Passage (as buildings only).

